# 11.34 fire19 (user 2026-10-16 "바닥에 먹자국만 지금의 5퍼센트 수준으로 줄이고 확정" / "자국도 불 따라 늦게" / "다음부터는 영상으로 제공해줘"):
# the 18th fire as confirmed, the ground stain at peak alpha .05 revealed near -> far with the fire (stainwipe sheet). One cast at
# timeScale .25 is recorded by SpellLab308 rec:fire19 (first person | side | top, one jpg per editor tick + index.csv);
# Tools/Art/SpellVFX308/rec308.py fire19 turns it into rec_fire19.mp4 (real speed + 1/4 speed, placed by game time).
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.25
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:fire19:34
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 8
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 14
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_fire19_end
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire19_end
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
